(5374840, 773818, 104643, '<td valign="top">Interpretation of Topic:  Creative title and excellent idea.<br/>Photography: Good sharp photo! Great choice of this vehicle in its rusty condtion which adds to the gloom of the situation.<br/>Viewers Reaction: I thank you for this important entry that speaks not only for the animals but also for many people who can''t escape their daily grind.<br/>You may not win, people do not want to see the down side of modern civilization caught in a photo.  It is nice to take a pretty picture, but you surpassed pretty by providing a great thought provoking image and title.</td>', 'Interpretation of Topic:  Creative title and excellent idea.Photography: Good sharp photo! Great choice of this vehicle in its rusty condtion which adds to the gloom of the situation.Viewers Reaction: I thank you for this important entry that speaks not only for the animals but also for many people who can''t escape their daily grind.You may not win, people do not want to see the down side of modern civilization caught in a photo.  It is nice to take a pretty picture, but you surpassed pretty by providing a great thought provoking image and title.', '2009-03-16 14:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
