(5387499, 773820, 86447, '<td valign="top">".....to always make her feel safe"<br/> <br/>You won''t.   And, it''s okay.<br/> <br/>She will need to experience LIFE in her own terms sometimes.   You be the backup...  not the first plan.  :)  <br/> <br/>"Tomorrow" she''ll be off to college.   Plan for it now.    Enjoy every moment.  <br/>You''re gonna miss this.  :)<br/> <br/> <br/>Beautiful and emotive image.<br/> <br/>Not voting.</td>', '".....to always make her feel safe" You won''t.   And, it''s okay. She will need to experience LIFE in her own terms sometimes.   You be the backup...  not the first plan.  :)   "Tomorrow" she''ll be off to college.   Plan for it now.    Enjoy every moment.  You''re gonna miss this.  :)  Beautiful and emotive image. Not voting.', '2009-03-17 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
