(5388421, 773849, 70484, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I haven''t seen any pics like this before, so for me, it''s a unique picture. I like the clarity and the composition. You will probably be getting voted down because of the message, but I voted on the picture and feels it gets a 10.</td>', 'I really like this. I haven''t seen any pics like this before, so for me, it''s a unique picture. I like the clarity and the composition. You will probably be getting voted down because of the message, but I voted on the picture and feels it gets a 10.', '2009-03-18 02:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388426, 773229, 70484, '<td valign="top">She would be a fool not too! Especially with this backdrop! Beautiful picture. The colors are great and i love the silhouette.</td>', 'She would be a fool not too! Especially with this backdrop! Beautiful picture. The colors are great and i love the silhouette.', '2009-03-18 02:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388428, 773444, 70484, '<td valign="top">Very good editorial capture. There is definitely a story here. I don''t know that it says that hope has arrived, but I do think it leaves room for hope to come. Nice capture.</td>', 'Very good editorial capture. There is definitely a story here. I don''t know that it says that hope has arrived, but I do think it leaves room for hope to come. Nice capture.', '2009-03-18 02:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388429, 773507, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like this with the blue background and scattered petals. I think it really works. However, in the middle bottom of the pic, there is a white mark that isn''t the shape of a petal. It''s kinda distracting.</td>', 'I like this with the blue background and scattered petals. I think it really works. However, in the middle bottom of the pic, there is a white mark that isn''t the shape of a petal. It''s kinda distracting.', '2009-03-18 02:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388431, 773490, 70484, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love the weathered feeling of the church, but my favorite part is the wispy cloud that seems to radiate from behind the church. Very nice. 10</td>', 'Great capture. I love the weathered feeling of the church, but my favorite part is the wispy cloud that seems to radiate from behind the church. Very nice. 10', '2009-03-18 02:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
