(5388435, 773035, 70484, '<td valign="top">I really like this capture. It does have a spiritual feeling to it. I don''t know that it is technically my favorite, but I do like it for it''s artistic quality.</td>', 'I really like this capture. It does have a spiritual feeling to it. I don''t know that it is technically my favorite, but I do like it for it''s artistic quality.', '2009-03-18 02:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
