(5388439, 771812, 70484, '<td valign="top">Well, Ria looks like she is hoping for a treat or a ball. You truly captured those puppy dog eyes we hear so much about.</td>', 'Well, Ria looks like she is hoping for a treat or a ball. You truly captured those puppy dog eyes we hear so much about.', '2009-03-18 02:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
