(5389994, 773736, 102024, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Grandma''s purse always has goodies in it!  But I think the composition could be stronger.  Feels accidental and I think this is a good idea that could have been much more emotive.  Tighter crop comes to mind, perhaps if the kid was looking at the purse instead of (seemingly past) grandma might make it stronger.</td>', 'Yes!  Grandma''s purse always has goodies in it!  But I think the composition could be stronger.  Feels accidental and I think this is a good idea that could have been much more emotive.  Tighter crop comes to mind, perhaps if the kid was looking at the purse instead of (seemingly past) grandma might make it stronger.', '2009-03-18 15:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5389998, 773827, 102024, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I like the lighting on the mother''s face, but I do like the idea that the light is coming from behind the child.  The expression on the mother''s face is nice.  Good idea.</td>', 'Not sure that I like the lighting on the mother''s face, but I do like the idea that the light is coming from behind the child.  The expression on the mother''s face is nice.  Good idea.', '2009-03-18 15:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
