(5391987, 773849, 100773, '<td valign="top">23 points? If I''ve done my math correctly, probably haven''t, but anyway... I give you 5 for a good composition, good use of the fish, and interpretation of this challenge, but the title is a bit to strong. Not everyone share this belief, thus to strong pointing it out like that.</td>', '23 points? If I''ve done my math correctly, probably haven''t, but anyway... I give you 5 for a good composition, good use of the fish, and interpretation of this challenge, but the title is a bit to strong. Not everyone share this belief, thus to strong pointing it out like that.', '2009-03-19 15:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5391991, 773542, 100773, '<td valign="top">This is certainly one type of hope. Good composition, but I think the subject is to dark for the background. More light should be lighting it up perhaps?</td>', 'This is certainly one type of hope. Good composition, but I think the subject is to dark for the background. More light should be lighting it up perhaps?', '2009-03-19 15:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392000, 773583, 100773, '<td valign="top">And the entire house burns to the ground? Light is hope, I believe, but I don''t get that feeling from this photo. The composition is good, good work with the DOF. The colors are good, almost perfectly balanced light between the small candles and the flames, but I''m sorry to say I don''t get the Hope as much as I want from photos in this challenge. 5</td>', 'And the entire house burns to the ground? Light is hope, I believe, but I don''t get that feeling from this photo. The composition is good, good work with the DOF. The colors are good, almost perfectly balanced light between the small candles and the flames, but I''m sorry to say I don''t get the Hope as much as I want from photos in this challenge. 5', '2009-03-19 15:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392002, 773308, 100773, '<td valign="top">You have either captured the head of a horse or a dragon a inch or two above the... in lack of a better word... motive. Interesting shot, but I expect more from photos in this challenge. Maybe a bit less from this photo being I find it overprossessed; correct me if I''m wrong.</td>', 'You have either captured the head of a horse or a dragon a inch or two above the... in lack of a better word... motive. Interesting shot, but I expect more from photos in this challenge. Maybe a bit less from this photo being I find it overprossessed; correct me if I''m wrong.', '2009-03-19 15:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392004, 773491, 100773, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Maybe the sky is a bit bright, but it works. 6</td>', 'I like this one. Maybe the sky is a bit bright, but it works. 6', '2009-03-19 15:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392005, 773582, 100773, '<td valign="top">I guess you could say that today. Nice idea. 7</td>', 'I guess you could say that today. Nice idea. 7', '2009-03-19 15:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392008, 773780, 100773, '<td valign="top">I love this idea; spring, new life, and everything, and the motive with its background is very good too, but I would like it to be a little bit more sharper. In advanced editing there''s room to fix that in an editing software.</td>', 'I love this idea; spring, new life, and everything, and the motive with its background is very good too, but I would like it to be a little bit more sharper. In advanced editing there''s room to fix that in an editing software.', '2009-03-19 15:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392014, 773799, 100773, '<td valign="top">There was just a matter of time before an eagle showed up. All of you with photos of eagles keep them chained in your backyard or something? This is, without doubt, a good shot. The sharpness towards the DOF is superb, and so is the momemt of capture, but to me personally there''s lacking a bit hope in this one.</td>', 'There was just a matter of time before an eagle showed up. All of you with photos of eagles keep them chained in your backyard or something? This is, without doubt, a good shot. The sharpness towards the DOF is superb, and so is the momemt of capture, but to me personally there''s lacking a bit hope in this one.', '2009-03-19 15:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392024, 773795, 100773, '<td valign="top">Did he score? Once you have paid attention to it, the small skyline in your photo is annoying. That should be cropped. Nevertheless, this is a good action photo that tells a story. There''s not much that could be improved, other than the skyline. Go out and buy a longer lens; you''re capable of shooting sports, now you only need the equipment to get as close as you want. You would probably get a better photo if you had gotten closer and shot vertically, being your motive is standing vertical. 6</td>', 'Did he score? Once you have paid attention to it, the small skyline in your photo is annoying. That should be cropped. Nevertheless, this is a good action photo that tells a story. There''s not much that could be improved, other than the skyline. Go out and buy a longer lens; you''re capable of shooting sports, now you only need the equipment to get as close as you want. You would probably get a better photo if you had gotten closer and shot vertically, being your motive is standing vertical. 6', '2009-03-19 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392025, 773024, 100773, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured, great detail and use of the Yin Yang. Did she put some sort of flour in her hands and clapped them together just before you shot? Funny effect nevertheless.</td>', 'Beautifully captured, great detail and use of the Yin Yang. Did she put some sort of flour in her hands and clapped them together just before you shot? Funny effect nevertheless.', '2009-03-19 16:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
