(5392034, 773699, 100773, '<td valign="top">If possible, try shoot from a lower angel, then your photo will be more... leveled... with the poor duck. This is a view everyone that have taken a walk in the park have seen. The title is good, and I feel so sorry for the poor ducky... I hope you gave him some!</td>', 'If possible, try shoot from a lower angel, then your photo will be more... leveled... with the poor duck. This is a view everyone that have taken a walk in the park have seen. The title is good, and I feel so sorry for the poor ducky... I hope you gave him some!', '2009-03-19 16:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
