(5396321, 773759, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> ...I''m guessing the one with the red jacket, white shirt with the ear to ear grin...yours? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Nope.  :-)  The "ear to ear grin" one just happened to catch the camera pointed his way (hard to miss that "Bigma").</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: ...I''m guessing the one with the red jacket, white shirt with the ear to ear grin...yours?  Nope.  :-)  The "ear to ear grin" one just happened to catch the camera pointed his way (hard to miss that "Bigma").', '2009-03-23 09:06:05.000000', NULL, 0),
