(5397966, 773444, 48228, '<td valign="top">SOMETIMES A PHOTO APPEARS THAT MAKE ONE STOP AND THINK.... <br/>This is one of those photos..... love from shez<br/> <br/>I have not commented on a photo that has moved me as much as this one. The emotion and the story it tells us speaks volumes to the viewer. As a thumb nail, I could not wait to see it enlarged. It deserved the ''BLUE'' as it tells a story of ''HOPE'' in an emotional picture form, without any words. <br/> <br/>I love everything about this one Enzo, and I personally THANK YOU for sharing it with us..... love from shez<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-24 10:16:22.</i></td>', 'SOMETIMES A PHOTO APPEARS THAT MAKE ONE STOP AND THINK.... This is one of those photos..... love from shez I have not commented on a photo that has moved me as much as this one. The emotion and the story it tells us speaks volumes to the viewer. As a thumb nail, I could not wait to see it enlarged. It deserved the ''BLUE'' as it tells a story of ''HOPE'' in an emotional picture form, without any words.  I love everything about this one Enzo, and I personally THANK YOU for sharing it with us..... love from shez', '2009-03-24 10:11:43.000000', '2009-03-24 10:16:22.000000', 0),
