(5400612, 773848, 68504, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this I thought simultaneously of my self portrait entry and of the possibility of its stunning commentary on the other challenge entries which of course you wouldn''t have seen.  Reminded me of cutout''s dqed entry in the gems.  But above all that it is almost offhandedly archetypal, deeply resonant.</td>', 'When I first saw this I thought simultaneously of my self portrait entry and of the possibility of its stunning commentary on the other challenge entries which of course you wouldn''t have seen.  Reminded me of cutout''s dqed entry in the gems.  But above all that it is almost offhandedly archetypal, deeply resonant.', '2009-03-25 16:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
