(5401593, 773831, 42013, '<td valign="top">Congrats Adam! It feels to me like the tree is also waiting on the bus. Or maybe the tree was a person who waited so long they put down roots!</td>', 'Congrats Adam! It feels to me like the tree is also waiting on the bus. Or maybe the tree was a person who waited so long they put down roots!', '2009-03-26 02:35:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5401968, 773444, 64446, '<td valign="top">I must confess I didn''t pay much attention to this one during the voting, on all that frenzy to get through all images...<br/> <br/>One needs to quiet the heart to really appreciate it...<br/> <br/>I now can''t stop gazing at this image as a whole and, specifically, on the children''s expressions.<br/>Beautifully composed (I don''t think the crop is an issue at all) and mastered post-processed.<br/>Congratulations!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-26 10:53:19.</i></td>', 'I must confess I didn''t pay much attention to this one during the voting, on all that frenzy to get through all images... One needs to quiet the heart to really appreciate it... I now can''t stop gazing at this image as a whole and, specifically, on the children''s expressions.Beautifully composed (I don''t think the crop is an issue at all) and mastered post-processed.Congratulations!!!', '2009-03-26 10:47:31.000000', '2009-03-26 10:53:19.000000', 0),
