(7110200, 773419, 98339, '<td valign="top">here are my critiques on this...you jars have to be perfectly aligned (use a ruler).  Labels must be straight and dead on.  In your processing your white must be "white" (use the eyedropper in levels).  Try to "overexpose" to make it high key. Are you able to bend the white background (poster board) so that it is under your candles thus making a seamless BG.  Or you could use a mirror with a white (ironed) sheet again making the BG seamless.</td>', 'here are my critiques on this...you jars have to be perfectly aligned (use a ruler).  Labels must be straight and dead on.  In your processing your white must be "white" (use the eyedropper in levels).  Try to "overexpose" to make it high key. Are you able to bend the white background (poster board) so that it is under your candles thus making a seamless BG.  Or you could use a mirror with a white (ironed) sheet again making the BG seamless.', '2013-10-03 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 0);
